      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering OCR Integration**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a suitable external provider for OCR and layout extraction. The goal is to make this provider clearly identifiable within the `extract_layout.py` file. I'm considering the best way to integrate it.\n\n\n**Implementing Layout Extraction**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Document AI as the external OCR and layout extraction provider, making it identifiable in the code. I'm actively working on creating the `extract_layout.py` file, incorporating the Document AI client library. The initial structure includes the necessary imports and placeholder functions to handle document processing. My next steps involve fleshing out the processing logic using the Document AI client.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789867572525,
          "start": 1789867570233
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc6bb439001Z4jAzh7286CH8Q",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc6baff5001PlNGUJlG12Zm8i",
      "session_id": "ses_f43945017ffeIfCjT69uEFqJjA",
